cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and the RiboMarker method paper."
type: software
title: "RiboMarker: a pipeline for RNA fragmentomics"
abstract: >-
  Turns small-RNA sequencing reads (FASTQ) from RiboMarker libraries into counts per gene,
  feature and RNA type, per-transcript coverage files and a technical QC report with
  consistency checks. Runs in a container image with the human and mouse references built in.
authors:
  - given-names: Martin
    family-names: Smelik
    affiliation: MultiD Analyses AB
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MultiD-Analyses/ribomarker-rna-fragmentomics"
url: "https://github.com/MultiD-Analyses/ribomarker-rna-fragmentomics"
keywords:
  - small RNA
  - RNA sequencing
  - cell-free RNA
  - RNA fragmentomics
  - quality control
  - Snakemake
references:
